<view class="page">
  <view class="section-header">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">选择乐谱</view>
      <view class="hint">上传文件、读取设备 SD 卡，或使用手机本地乐谱。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="source-tabs">
    <view class="source-tab {{activeSource == 'upload' ? 'active' : ''}}"
          data-source="upload" bindtap="switchSource">
      <view class="source-icon">＋</view>
      <view>上传文件</view>
    </view>
    <view class="source-tab {{activeSource == 'sd' ? 'active' : ''}}"
          data-source="sd" bindtap="switchSource">
      <view class="source-icon">SD</view>
      <view>设备 SD 卡</view>
    </view>
    <view class="source-tab {{activeSource == 'local' ? 'active' : ''}}"
          data-source="local" bindtap="switchSource">
      <view class="source-icon">▣</view>
      <view>手机本地</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{activeSource == 'upload'}}" class="card upload-panel">
    <view class="upload-mark">♬</view>
    <view class="upload-title">从手机选择乐谱文件</view>
    <view class="hint upload-hint">支持标准 JSON 乐谱和 MIDI 文件。导入后会持久保存到小程序本地，并设为当前乐谱。</view>
    <button class="primary-btn upload-button" bindtap="chooseScoreFile">选择 JSON / MIDI 文件</button>
    <view class="format-note">
      JSON 至少需要 title、bpm 和 notes；MIDI 会在手机端转换为可评分音符。
    </view>
    <view class="ai-upload-block">
      <view class="upload-title ai-upload-title">AI 识别图片乐谱</view>
      <view class="hint upload-hint">选择或拍摄一张清晰的单页乐谱，图片压缩后由设备调用豆包识别。</view>
      <view class="ai-upload-actions">
        <button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="chooseSheetImage">选择乐谱图片</button>
        <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="recognizeSheetImage"
                disabled="{{aiRecognizing || !selectedSheetImage}}">AI 识谱</button>
      </view>
      <view class="ai-task-status {{aiRecognitionStatus}}"
            wx:if="{{aiRecognitionStatus != 'idle'}}">
        {{aiRecognitionMessage}}
      </view>
      <view class="sheet-image-preview" wx:if="{{selectedSheetImage}}">
        <image src="{{selectedSheetImage.path}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
        <view class="hint">图片已准备，可开始 AI 识谱</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{activeSource == 'sd'}}">
    <view class="card sd-toolbar">
      <view class="search-row">
        <input class="search-input" value="{{sdSearch}}" placeholder="搜索标题或文件名"
               bindinput="onSdSearchInput" confirm-type="search"
               bindconfirm="searchSdScores"></input>
        <button class="primary-btn search-btn" bindtap="searchSdScores"
                loading="{{sdLoading}}">搜索</button>
      </view>
      <view class="hint">读取设备目录 /sdcard/scores，仅显示有效且不超过 256 KiB 的 JSON 乐谱。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card empty-state" wx:if="{{!sdPresent}}">
      尚未连接设备，或设备未检测到 SD 乐谱目录。
    </view>
    <view class="card empty-state" wx:elif="{{!sdLoading && sdPresent && !sdScores.length}}">
      SD 卡中没有符合条件的乐谱。
    </view>
    <view class="score-list">
      <view class="card score-item" wx:for="{{sdScores}}" wx:key="filename">
        <view class="row between">
          <view class="score-main">
            <view class="score-title">{{item.title}}</view>
            <view class="score-meta">{{item.filename}}</view>
            <view class="score-meta">{{item.bpm}} BPM · {{item.time_signature}} · {{item.note_count}} 个音符</view>
          </view>
          <view class="tag">设备 SD</view>
        </view>
        <view class="score-actions">
          <button class="primary-btn mini-btn" data-filename="{{item.filename}}"
                  bindtap="selectSdScore">选择乐谱</button>
          <button class="secondary-btn mini-btn" data-filename="{{item.filename}}"
                  bindtap="saveSdScoreToLocal">保存到本地</button>
          <button class="ghost-btn mini-btn" data-filename="{{item.filename}}"
                  data-title="{{item.title}}" bindtap="renameSdScore">重命名</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="pagination" wx:if="{{sdTotalPages > 0}}">
      <button class="ghost-btn page-btn" bindtap="previousSdPage"
              disabled="{{sdPage <= 1}}">上一页</button>
      <view>第 {{sdPage}} / {{sdTotalPages}} 页 · 共 {{sdTotal}} 首</view>
      <button class="ghost-btn page-btn" bindtap="nextSdPage"
              disabled="{{sdPage >= sdTotalPages}}">下一页</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{activeSource == 'local'}}">
    <view class="card local-summary">
      <view>
        <view class="upload-title">手机本地乐谱</view>
        <view class="hint">已持久保存 {{localScores.length}} 首，删除后会同时移除本地 JSON 文件。</view>
      </view>
      <button class="secondary-btn small-action" data-source="upload"
              bindtap="switchSource">继续上传</button>
    </view>
    <view class="card empty-state" wx:if="{{!localScores.length}}">
      暂无本地乐谱。请先上传 JSON / MIDI，或从设备 SD 卡保存一份。
    </view>
    <view class="score-list">
      <view class="card score-item {{currentScoreId == item.id ? 'current' : ''}}"
            wx:for="{{localScores}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row between">
          <view class="score-main" bindtap="viewLocalScore" data-id="{{item.id}}">
            <view class="score-title">{{item.title}}</view>
            <view class="score-meta">{{item.bpm}} BPM · {{item.time_signature}} · {{item.noteCount}} 个音符</view>
            <view class="score-meta">{{item.updatedAt}} · {{item.source}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="tag" wx:if="{{currentScoreId == item.id}}">当前</view>
        </view>
        <view class="score-actions">
          <button class="primary-btn mini-btn" bindtap="selectLocalScore"
                  data-id="{{item.id}}">选择并同步</button>
          <button class="ghost-btn mini-btn" bindtap="renameLocalScore"
                  data-id="{{item.id}}">重命名</button>
          <button class="danger-btn mini-btn" bindtap="deleteLocalScore"
                  data-id="{{item.id}}">删除</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
